# ASCII fight pictures stay off main

ASCII fight pictures live only on branch `ascii-fight`. `main` must not contain `show_fight`, `HERO_STAND`, `hold_frame`, `MONSTER_ART`, or cursor-home fight animation (`\033`). Do not merge `ascii-fight` into `main`, and do not copy that code into `main`'s `app.py`.

On `main`, `fight()` stays text: one room line, then the taunt. The picture frames belong on `ascii-fight` only.
